<a href="/articles/instance/2755013/bin/1471-2164-10-447-S8.XLS" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" class="usa-link">Click here for file</a><sup> (16KB, XLS) </sup>
</div></div></section><section class="sm xbox font-sm" id="S9"><div class="caption p">
<span>Additional file 9</span><p><strong>Chemotaxis proteins (Che) and Two-Component systems</strong>. Spreadsheet listing genes coding for Che proteins, putative sensor histidine kinases, response regulators and methyl-accepting chemotaxis proteins (MCPs).</p>
