<li id="B55">
<cite>Fouts DE, Tyler HL, DeBoy RT, Daugherty S, Ren Q, Badger JH, Durkin AS, Huot H, Shrivastava S, Kothari S, et al.  Complete genome sequence of the N2-fixing broad host range endophyte Klebsiella pneumoniae 342 and virulence predictions verified in mice. PLoS Genet. 2008;4:e1000141. doi: 10.1371/journal.pgen.1000141.</cite> [<a href="https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pgen.1000141" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DOI</a>] [<a href="/articles/PMC2453333/" class="usa-link">PMC free article</a>] [<a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/18654632/" class="usa-link">PubMed</a>] [<a href="https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=PLoS%20Genet&amp;title=Complete%20genome%20sequence%20of%20the%20N2-fixing%20broad%20host%20range%20endophyte%20Klebsiella%20pneumoniae%20342%20and%20virulence%20predictions%20verified%20in%20mice&amp;author=DE%20Fouts&amp;author=HL%20Tyler&amp;author=RT%20DeBoy&amp;author=S%20Daugherty&amp;author=Q%20Ren&amp;volume=4&amp;publication_year=2008&amp;pages=e1000141&amp;pmid=18654632&amp;doi=10.1371/journal.pgen.1000141&amp;" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Scholar</a>]</li>
